1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,394
Lesson 4.6: LogTime and Exporting the File.

2
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,114
With the care plan complete, two things are left in ThoroughCare:

3
00:00:13,154 --> 00:00:17,742
logging the time, and exporting the encounter as a PDF.

4
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:22,383
Every encounter logs exactly 60 minutes: that's our billing time.

5
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:25,621
The task type is always Monthly Clinical Review.

6
00:00:25,671 --> 00:00:30,484
And the time is performed by the patient's provider, never by the care manager.

7
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,322
Scrolling back up to the top of Care Management brings us to the task timer.

8
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:49,028
First comes the task type. We always use Monthly Clinical Review,

9
00:00:49,068 --> 00:00:51,940
so it's worth checking before anything else.

10
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:57,091
Performed By has to be the provider's name, not the care manager's.

11
00:01:01,933 --> 00:01:05,208
It's the patient's primary provider from the task information:

12
00:01:05,248 --> 00:01:07,316
here, Keisha Asante.

13
00:01:11,633 --> 00:01:13,689
Searching the list finds her name.

14
00:01:15,867 --> 00:01:18,838
This name has to match the provider on the task portal.

15
00:01:18,878 --> 00:01:23,533
If it doesn't, we correct it here before submitting the encounter.

16
00:01:28,367 --> 00:01:33,509
With the task type and provider set, the task timer gets exactly 60 minutes.

17
00:01:34,623 --> 00:01:39,467
Clicking Log Time records it, and Logged this month now shows 60 minutes.

18
00:01:42,228 --> 00:01:46,307
To double-check the details, View Logs opens the time logs.

19
00:01:47,433 --> 00:01:50,647
Here we confirm the category, Monthly Clinical Review,

20
00:01:50,687 --> 00:01:55,022
the provider, Keisha Asante, and exactly 60 minutes.

21
00:01:57,733 --> 00:01:58,852
If anything is wrong,

22
00:01:58,892 --> 00:02:02,561
deleting the log and logging the time again sets it straight.

23
00:02:03,667 --> 00:02:06,457
Delete asks for a quick confirmation first.

24
00:02:08,633 --> 00:02:13,096
Then the 60 minutes go in again, with the same task type and provider.

25
00:02:18,170 --> 00:02:21,473
Once the log is right, the encounter is ready to export.

26
00:02:21,513 --> 00:02:24,981
Print / Preview sits right next to the timer.

27
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:27,824
It opens the printing options:

28
00:02:27,864 --> 00:02:31,444
everything that appears in the final encounter file.

29
00:02:33,633 --> 00:02:35,625
The file follows one fixed structure,

30
00:02:35,665 --> 00:02:39,123
so these options should match exactly what's checked here:

31
00:02:39,173 --> 00:02:44,358
the program, patient conditions, the care plan with its problem notes, goals, barriers,

32
00:02:44,398 --> 00:02:53,345
interventions and clinical review notes, then clinical data, providers, resources and support, time logs, and patient consent.

33
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:59,936
Setting them once in our ThoroughCare account keeps them the same for every patient.

34
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:07,026
The date range runs from the first of the month to the end of it.

35
00:03:08,123 --> 00:03:11,109
Clicking Download PDF starts the export.

36
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:17,965
A moment later, a green pop-up tells us the report is ready to download.

37
00:03:18,015 --> 00:03:21,387
The file name carries the patient's initial and last name,

38
00:03:21,427 --> 00:03:24,325
so it's easy to match to the right patient.

39
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:31,196
Clicking the pop-up downloads the file straight to our computer.

40
00:03:34,433 --> 00:03:38,324
That's the file we upload to Practice Fusion for the billing encounter,

41
00:03:38,364 --> 00:03:42,104
and with it, the patient is complete in ThoroughCare.

42
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:48,907
To wrap up: the task type is always Monthly Clinical Review.

43
00:03:48,957 --> 00:03:53,553
Performed By is the patient's provider, matching the task information.

44
00:03:53,603 --> 00:03:58,345
We log exactly 60 minutes, and confirm the details in View Logs.

45
00:03:58,395 --> 00:04:03,009
Print / Preview uses our fixed options, with this month's date range.

46
00:04:03,059 --> 00:04:07,677
And the downloaded PDF goes to Practice Fusion for the billing encounter.

47
00:04:09,833 --> 00:04:13,851
Next, the encounter file moves to Practice Fusion for billing.
